---
// Package initialization order (#3): imported packages -> package vars -> init() -> main().
const W = 900;
const H = 316;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}

const i1 = arrow(216, 114, 242, 114);
const i2 = arrow(438, 114, 464, 114);
const i3 = arrow(670, 114, 696, 114);
---
<figure class="gp12f">
  <div class="gp12f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Initialization timeline: imported dependencies initialize first, then package variables, then init functions in file and source order, and finally main.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Startup execution order before main() begins</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thứ tự thực thi lúc khởi động trước khi main() chạy</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="46" width="196" height="136" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="34" y="72" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Imported packages</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Package được import</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="34" y="96" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>db vars, then db.init()</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>biến của db, rồi db.init()</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="34" y="120" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>including blank imports</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>kể cả import ẩn danh</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="34" y="142" class="m">_ "pkg"</text>

    <g><path d={i1.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={i1.head} class="ar" /></g>

    <rect x="242" y="46" width="196" height="136" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="256" y="72" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Package vars</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Biến cấp package</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="256" y="96" class="m">var configReady = ...</text>
    <text x="256" y="120" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>evaluated before init()</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tính xong trước init()</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="256" y="142" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>in main package</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>trong package main</tspan>
    </text>

    <g><path d={i2.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={i2.head} class="ar" /></g>

    <rect x="464" y="46" width="206" height="136" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="478" y="72" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3. Package init()</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Các hàm init()</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="478" y="96" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>file alphabetical order</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>theo thứ tự tên file</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="478" y="120" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>then source order</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>rồi thứ tự trong file</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="478" y="142" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>cannot return error</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>không trả về được error</tspan>
    </text>

    <g><path d={i3.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={i3.head} class="ar" /></g>

    <rect x="696" y="46" width="184" height="136" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="710" y="72" class="b">4. main()</text>
    <text x="710" y="96" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>normal entry point</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>điểm chạy chính</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="710" y="120" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>handles errors cleanly</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>xử lý error tường minh</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="710" y="142" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>skipped by go test</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>go test không gọi main()</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Warning box below */}
    <rect x="20" y="210" width="860" height="84" rx="6" class="hot" />
    <text x="36" y="236" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Why putting database pools or I/O in init() breaks tests and error handling:</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao mở kết nối DB hoặc làm I/O trong init() gây khó cho test và xử lý lỗi:</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="260" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. init() cannot return an error to callers, so failures force a panic instead of retries or fallbacks.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. init() không trả về được error cho bên gọi, nên gặp lỗi chỉ có cách panic thay vì thử lại hay fallback.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="280" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Every go test in the package triggers init() automatically and couples tests to package-level globals.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Mọi lệnh go test trong package đều tự kích hoạt init(), kéo theo kết nối và biến toàn cục.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go runs package initialization automatically when imported, before <code>main()</code> or any test begins. Keep <code>init()</code> for static, failure-free registration; use explicit <code>New...</code> or <code>openDB</code> constructors for I/O.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Go tự chạy phần khởi tạo ngay khi package được import, trước khi <code>main()</code> hay bất kỳ bài test nào bắt đầu. Chỉ giữ <code>init()</code> cho các đăng ký tĩnh không thể lỗi; với I/O hãy dùng hàm tạo tường minh như <code>New...</code> hay <code>openDB</code>.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp12f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp12f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp12f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp12f text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp12f .h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp12f .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp12f .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .gp12f .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .gp12f .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp12f .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp12f .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp12f .ar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp12f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
